# Maester

> Maester is an open-source PowerShell framework that tests the security configuration of Microsoft 365, Entra ID, Azure and Active Directory against CIS, CISA SCuBA, Microsoft guidance and the Zero Trust Assessment.

## Documentation Sets

- [Abridged documentation](https://maester.dev/llms-small.txt): a compact version of the documentation for Maester, with non-essential content removed
- [Complete documentation](https://maester.dev/llms-full.txt): the full documentation for Maester

## Notes

- The complete documentation includes all content from the official documentation
- The content is automatically generated from the same source as the official documentation
